msgid "QoS Mode Switch"
msgstr "QoS 一键切换"

msgid "Switch between NSS hardware shaping, software shaping and no QoS. Software mode stops ECM hardware offload so the CPU shaper actually sees the packets."
msgstr "在 NSS 硬件整形、软件整形和关闭 QoS 之间切换。软件模式会先停止 ECM 硬件加速，确保 CPU 整形真正生效。"

msgid "Operating mode"
msgstr "工作模式"

msgid "Mode"
msgstr "模式"

msgid "Off — no QoS, ECM hardware acceleration enabled"
msgstr "关闭 — 不启用 QoS，保持 ECM 硬件加速"

msgid "Hardware QoS — NSS shaper, ECM enabled (recommended)"
msgstr "硬件简易 QoS — NSS 整形，保持 ECM 开启（推荐）"

msgid "Software QoS — ECM stopped, CPU shaping"
msgstr "软件多功能 QoS — 停止 ECM，由 CPU 整形"

msgid "WAN device"
msgstr "WAN 设备"

msgid "auto resolves the physical device from network.wan; an explicit name is mainly used for status output."
msgstr "auto 会从 network.wan 解析物理设备；手动填写主要用于状态显示。"

msgid "Download bandwidth (kbit/s)"
msgstr "下行带宽（kbit/s）"

msgid "0 or empty disables shaping in that direction. Both values are required for eqos."
msgstr "填 0 或留空表示不限制该方向；eqos 模式必须同时填写上下行。"

msgid "Upload bandwidth (kbit/s)"
msgstr "上行带宽（kbit/s）"

msgid "Software engine"
msgstr "软件模式引擎"

msgid "SQM + Cake — best general purpose shaper"
msgstr "SQM + Cake — 通用整形，功能最全"

msgid "eqos — per-IP/MAC limits on the LAN"
msgstr "eqos — 按 IP/MAC 限制局域网设备"

msgid "NSS mode uses the nss-zk.qos script from sqm-scripts-nss. Software mode stops qca-nss-ecm first; returning to Off or NSS restores it. The detailed SQM and eqos settings remain available through the buttons below."
msgstr "NSS 模式使用 sqm-scripts-nss 提供的 nss-zk.qos。软件模式会先停止 qca-nss-ecm，切回关闭或 NSS 模式时自动恢复。详细 SQM 与 eqos 参数可通过下方按钮进入配置。"

msgid "Current status"
msgstr "当前状态"

msgid "Open SQM settings"
msgstr "打开 SQM 详细设置"

msgid "Open eqos settings"
msgstr "打开 eqos 详细设置"

msgid "Refresh"
msgstr "刷新"

msgid "Refresh page"
msgstr "刷新页面"

msgid "Close"
msgstr "关闭"

msgid "Status unavailable"
msgstr "无法获取状态"

msgid "QoS mode applied"
msgstr "QoS 模式已应用"

msgid "The selected mode was applied. Current status:"
msgstr "所选模式已应用，当前状态如下："

msgid "No status output."
msgstr "没有状态输出。"

msgid "Apply failed"
msgstr "应用失败"

msgid "The mode could not be applied. Check the error below and the system log."
msgstr "模式应用失败，请检查下方错误信息和系统日志。"

msgid "The QoS service returned an error."
msgstr "QoS 服务返回错误。"
